        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 67 Innismore, Crumlin, Dublin 12 to the market a superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned within this mature and ever popular development. Innismore is a highly sought-after location thanks to its close proximity to a host of local amenities including shops, cafés, schools, parks and leisure facilities. The area is very well serviced by public transport with numerous Dublin Bus routes nearby providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, while the M50 and major road networks are also easily accessible.\n\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation spans to c. 83 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, spacious lounge, kitchen/dining area, and guest bathroom on the ground floor, while upstairs hosts three well-proportioned bedrooms and an additional bathroom. The property is presented in fantastic condition throughout.\n\nNo. 67 further benefits from off street parking to the front via a private driveway, side access and a low maintenance sunny rear garden, perfect for relaxing or entertaining during the summer months. The added advantage of no onward chain ensures a smooth and straightforward transaction for the successful purchaser.\n\nThis fantastic home is sure to appeal to first time buyers and growing families seeking a well-located property in a mature and established setting. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 83 sqm\n• BER C\n• 3 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Semi detached home\n• Off street parking\n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Sunny rear garden\n• Side entrance\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• No onwards chain\n• Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors\n• Viewing highly advised!\n\n\nMeasurements;\nEntrance Hallway: 0.73m X 3.33m.\nLiving Room: 2.98m X 5.27m.\nDining Area: 1.92m X 3.73m.\nKitchen: 2.83m X 3.74m.\nBedroom 1: 3.12m X 4.23m.\nBedroom 2: 2.79m X 4.37m.\nBedroom 3: 1.93m X 2.58m.\nBathroom: 1.53m X 2.94m.\nW/C: 0/82m X 1.52m.\n\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D12 KX31"
      },
